completion.content:
A song should remain only when its ID is present in the current song library, liked songs, and downloaded songs; the complementary library IDs are the reviewed removal targets.

```python
song_library_ids = {item["song_id"] for item in song_library}
liked_song_ids = {item["song_id"] for item in liked_songs}
downloaded_song_ids = {item["song_id"] for item in downloaded_songs}
song_keep_ids = song_library_ids & liked_song_ids & downloaded_song_ids
song_remove_ids = sorted(song_library_ids - song_keep_ids)
print({"songs_reviewed": len(song_library_ids), "songs_to_keep": len(song_keep_ids), "songs_to_remove": len(song_remove_ids)})
```

